// BAML schema: England Subject Taxonomy Enums (BIEP v2)
//
// Canonical subject + awarding-body + qualification-level taxonomy used by
// the England pipeline (Change 2). All enums are reused across the 3
// board-specific extractors (AQA, OCR, Edexcel).
//
// Re-gen: cd cianfhoghlaim && uv run baml-cli generate
//
// Reference: openspec/changes/2026-07-21-biep-v2-england-aqa-ocr-baml-pipeline-v1/

